ype":"message","user":"UQL6475CG","text":"なるほど！みてみます！","ts":"1635656200.011700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RcYs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f77dcceb-d8a5-4cf4-930a-39bd7028d9c0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; completeUnimported\nですね","ts":"1635655998.011300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3tf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc1f6839-09af-4a46-828a-347a93d7804f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```  call coc#config('go.goplsOptions', {\n        \\ 'completeUnimported': v:true,\n        \\ 'codelenses': {\n          \\ 'test': v:true,\n          \\ },\n          \\ })```","ts":"1635655987.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["UQL6475CG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zzdxi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"362b6a6a-7243-4424-ba64-896e5334f66a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"goplsのオプションでできた気がします","ts":"1635655976.010800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Usry"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31d5269f-6e2c-4f7a-b840-0265a8b1b373","type":"message","user":"UQL6475CG","text":"もしご存じの方がいれば教えていただきたいです:bow:\ncocのcoc-goを使ってるるのですが、vscodeみたいにimportしていないパッケージ名を補完することってできますかね:thinking_face:\nvscodeだとこんな感じのやつなんですが、なにか設定が必要でしょうか。\n(questionチャンネルのほうがよかったですかね)","ts":"1635655083.009100","files":[{"id":"F02KNLZ9KV1","created":1635654723,"timestamp":1635654723,"name":"スクリーンショット 2021-10-31 13.32.00.png","title":"スクリーンショット 2021-10-31 13.32.00.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UQL6475CG","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":23516,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02KNLZ9KV1/________________________